    "items": [
      "Changing `EncForsworn01TemplateMelee` 023AA9 also needs `ccBGSSSE059_Crowstooth` 00086D:ccbgssse059-ba_dragonplate.esl (PC × 1.25, min 25, max 100): it uses 023AA9 as its template but not for `Stats` (on *Named Forsworn*).",
      "Changing `EncForsworn01TemplateMissile` 043BE3 also needs `ccEDHSSE002_Daenella` 000877:ccedhsse002-splkntset.esl and `ccEDHSSE002_DaenellaCorpse` 00080E:ccedhsse002-splkntset.esl (the Spell Knight quest NPC and her corpse, level 1): same pattern (on no census page).",
      "Changing the Melee or Magic template of rungs 02–06 also needs that rung's Briarheart: `EncForsworn02TemplateBossMelee` 04430B · `…BossMagic` 04430A (7), `03` 04430D · 04430C (16), `04` 04430F · 04430E (27), `05` 044311 · 044310 (38), `06` 044313 · 044312 (51): each uses the rung template as its template but not for `Stats` (on *Forsworn Briarheart*).",
      "`EncForsworn01TemplateMagic`, the Missile templates of rungs 02–06 and the two CC wrappers: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "Every other Forsworn record (the Breton and Berserk variants of each rung, the two `TreasCorpseForsworn*` corpses and every `LvlForsworn*` wrapper) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
